_05_89","text":"I-I know I'm being selfish, but I really like this job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_90","text":"O-of course! I always mess up and cause all sorts of trouble, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_91","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_91","text":"But you saved me, so have some confidence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_92","text":"I-I didn't!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_93","text":"You even landed in the hospital because of me. How's that saving anyone?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_94","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_94","text":"Will you keep protecting me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_95","text":"Of course!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_96","text":"I'll definitely make sure you don't get hurt next time!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_97","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_97","text":"Will you hold me like last time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_98","text":"Huh? Why are you bringing this up all of a sudden...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_99","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_99","text":"You don't want to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_100","text":"It's not that!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_101","text":"I-I do like it! I-I'll hug you with all I've got!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_miranda_05_102","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_miranda_05_102","text":"Miranda puts her arms around my head, just like she did at the park.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},